      "featured": true,
      "description": "ROOM Baku and DaMir – House of Imagination present 7-YA (SevenYouAre), an art project held from September 8–14, 2025, in Ivanovka. For one week, seven artists — Vusala Agharaziyeva, Nigar Familsoy, Gunel Akhundlu, Orkhan Garayev, Sarkhan Gadzhiev, Mushfig Heydarov, and Rufana Mamedova — lived and worked together, exploring the multiplicity of the \"Self.\" The name \"7-YA\" reflects the idea that within each person exists a multitude of states and roles. Seven participants, seven days, and seven facets of identity came together in paintings, sketches, and a collective installation shaped through dialogue, workshops, and shared creation. The exhibition is hosted at ROOM Baku — a wine house in the city center where wine culture meets art and gastronomy. Here, the artists' works and a video portrait of the project invite visitors to reflect on identity and the courage to be many at once.",
